ok - ap: the purchase ledger agrees with the creditors control account  # REQ: AP-021,AP-022
ok - ap: the register shows why a blocked invoice cannot be paid  # REQ: AP-003,AP-008,AP-023
ok - ap: the supplier enquiry reports the ledger balance and the unverified banks  # REQ: AP-001,AP-002
